==============================================================================
argmin_x [ |x(x-1)| (1/x^2 + 2/(x-1)^2) ] = 0.414214 omega_F  (sqrt2 - 1 = 0.414214); f_min = 2.828427 (2 sqrt2 = 2.828427)
