Delta/2pi at the ratio optimum = 82.01 GHz (source '~82 GHz')
clock qubit |0,0>: R_SE/|Omega| = 4 sqrt2 gamma/omega_F = 5.656854 gamma/omega_F; P_SE = 2 sqrt2 pi gamma/omega_F = 8.885766 gamma/omega_F = 8.7063e-04 for 9Be+
|2,2> <-> |1,1>:  P_SE = 8 pi/sqrt6 gamma/omega_F = 10.260399 gamma/omega_F = 1.0053e-03  (source '~0.001') - do NOT conflate the two ~1e-3 figures
|delta_(0<->0)/Omega_(0<->0)| = 4 sqrt2 omega_0/omega_F = 3.571e-02 (table 3.6e-2)
invariant delta_(0<->0) = -(omega_0/gamma) R_SE: worst relative residual over 200 samples = 4.03e-16

